+### 9c. off/prod results (round 5)
+
+off/prod = `--spec-type` off, production sampling (agent temp 1.0, top_p 0.95,
+top_k 20, seed 0; mem temp 0.2, seed 0). fg decode tok/s =
+sum(predicted_n)/sum(predicted_ms):
+
+| phase | off-greedy | off-prod | off-prod no-length |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| single-agent | 55.1 | 55.6 | 55.6 |
+| single-mem | 55.6 | 55.4 | 55.4 |
+| dual-agent | 26.3 | 31.2 | 32.6 |
+| dual-mem | 25.0 | 25.5 | 25.5 |
+
+off-greedy vs off-prod are not comparable to each other (different sampling);
+off-prod is the base for the A/prod run. No error rows. off-prod dual-agent
+has 10 rows with tool_call_json_valid=false (stochastic temp-1.0 output);
+all other rows are valid.
